<title>UK: Lehman appoints executive to emerging markets.</title>
<headline>Lehman appoints executive to emerging markets.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers appointed Jim Fernandez as executive director and head of emerging market sales for Europe, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Fernandez, who will be based in London, will report to John McDonald, managing director and head of fixed income sales for Europe and to Bill Geisler, managing director and global head of emerging market sales.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Lehman Brothers, Fernandez was in charge of emerging market sales for the Western region at Merrill Lynch in San Francisco.</p>
<p>London Newsroom, 44 171 542 5110</p>
